[Term]
id: PROMOT:0000015
name: Entité anatomique liée à un phénotype
def: "An anatomical entity related to a phenotype such that the anatomical entity is the location of the phenotype. In other words, the phenotype is a disposition of the anatomical entity." []
comment: (JP : unsure, attention au lien avec les body structures)
property_value: IAO:0000117 "Paul Fabry, https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927" xsd:string

[Term]
id: PROMOT:0000016
name: Phenotypically related body structure
def: "A body structure related to a phenotype such that the body structure is the location of the phenotype." []
comment: (JP: unsure about definition)
property_value: IAO:0000117 "Paul Fabry, https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927" xsd:string

[Term]
id: PROMOT:0000017
name: Fonction organique liée à un phénotype
def: "A body function related to a phenotype such that the body function is impacted by the phenotype existence." []
comment: (JP: unsure about definition)
property_value: IAO:0000117 "Paul Fabry, https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927" xsd:string

[Term]
id: PROMOT:0000018
name: Activity or participation related body structure
def: "A body structure that is involved in an activity or a participation. The boby structure is needed in order to the activity or participation to occurs." []
property_value: IAO:0000117 "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927" xsd:string

[Term]
id: PROMOT:0000019
