[Term]
id: PROMOT:0000033
name: Date
def: "Time indication that refers to a specific day and usually includes mention of the month and/or the year according to a specific calendar system." []
xref: http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C25164
property_value: IAO:0000117 "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927" xsd:string

[Term]
id: PROMOT:0000034
name: Date of assessment
def: "La date à laquelle une entité a été formellement identifiée, par exemple la date à laquelle un phénotype a été identifié via une procédure médicale." []
comment: [derived from EURO-NMD] Atalia A et al., EURO-NMD registry: federated FAIR infrastructure, innovative technologies and concepts of a patient-centred registry for rare neuromuscular disorders. Orphanet J Rare Dis. 2024 Feb 14;19(1):66. doi: 10.1186/s13023-024-03059-3. PMID: 38355534; PMCID: PMC10865673.
is_a: PROMOT:0000033 ! Date
property_value: IAO:0000117 "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927" xsd:string
property_value: seeAlso SNOMED:363778006
property_value: seeAlso SNOMED:439272007
property_value: seeAlso SNOMED:704321009

[Term]
id: PROMOT:0000035
name: Date of resolution
def: "La date à laquelle une disposition anormale, telle qu’une maladie ou un phénotype, cesse d’exister." []
comment: [derived from RD-CDM] Graefe, A.S.L., Hübner, M.R., Rehburg, F. et al. An ontology-based rare disease common data model harmonising international registries, FHIR, and Phenopackets. Sci Data 12, 234 (2025). https://doi.org/10.1038/s41597-025-04558-z
xref: http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C178992
is_a: PROMOT:0000033 ! Date
property_value: IAO:0000117 "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927" xsd:string
property_value: seeAlso HP:0034382

